return ['domain'=>'zinn-migrate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-migrate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:49:02+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:49:02+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Migrate'=>'Zinn® Migrate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate','Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration.'=>'Hupakia tovuti hii ya WordPress — faili na hifadhidata — kwenye kumbukumbu moja ambayo Zinn Digital® inaweza kuivuta, kwa seva pangishi ambazo hatuwezi kuzifikia kwa njia nyingine yoyote. Isakinishe kwenye tovuti unayoONDOKA, bonyeza kitufe kimoja, na ubandike kiungo kwenye uhamishaji wako wa Zinn®.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Move this site to Zinn®'=>'Hamisha tovuti hii hadi Zinn®','Move to Zinn®'=>'Hamishia kwa Zinn®','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kufanya hivi.','This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link.'=>'Hii inafunganya kila kitu kwenye tovuti hii — faili zake na hifadhidata yake — kwenye kumbukumbu moja, na inakupa kiungo cha faragha kuelekea humo. Bandika kiungo hicho kwenye uhamishaji wako kwenye Zinn® na tutaleta tovuti hiyo. Hakuna chochote hapa kinachotumwa popote hadi utakapoamua kushiriki kiungo hicho.','You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you.'=>'Huenda usihitaji hii. Ikiwa seva pangishi yako ya zamani inakupa FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk au DirectAdmin, Zinn® inaweza kuleta tovuti moja kwa moja kwa kutumia maelezo hayo na unaweza kuruka kabisa programu-jalizi hii — ni ya haraka zaidi na hakuna kinachosalia baadaye. Tumia hii wakati hakuna mojawapo ya hayo inayopatikana kwako.','Room on this server'=>'Nafasi kwenye seva hii','This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down.'=>'Seva hii haitatuambia ni kiasi gani cha nafasi ya diski kiko wazi, kwa hivyo hatuwezi kukuangalia. Kifurushi kinahitaji takriban %s. Ikiwa huna uhakika kama kuna nafasi hiyo, uliza mpangishaji wako kabla ya kukiunda — seva inayoishiwa na nafasi katikati ya mchakato huzima tovuti.','The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free.'=>'Kifurushi kinahitaji takriban %1$s na seva hii ina nafasi ya %2$s iliyo wazi.','Build the package'=>'Unda kifurushi','Building…'=>'Inaunda…','Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written.'=>'Inapakia sasa: %1$s. Faili %2$s kufikia sasa, %3$s zimeandikwa.','your files'=>'Faili zako','your database'=>'Hifadhidata yako','Continue'=>'Endelea','Cancel and delete'=>'Ghairi na ufute','Your package is ready'=>'Kifurushi chako kiko tayari','Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:'=>'Nakili kiungo hiki na ukibandike kwenye uhamiaji wako kwenye Zinn®:','Size: %s.'=>'Ukubwa: %s.','Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished.'=>'Chukulia kiungo hiki kama nenosiri. Yeyote aliye nacho anaweza kupakua tovuti yako yote, ikijumuisha hifadhidata yako. Tunafuta kifurushi kiotomatiki saa 24 baada ya kuundwa — kifute wewe mwenyewe mara tu uhamishaji wako utakapokamilika.','Delete the package now'=>'Futa kifurushi sasa','Build it again'=>'Jenga tena','This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead.'=>'Seva hii haina kiendelezi cha PHP cha ZipArchive, kwa hivyo hatuwezi kutengeneza kifurushi hapa. Mwombe mtoa huduma wako wa upangishaji akiamishe, au badala yake tumia fomu ya uhamishaji kwenye Zinn® pamoja na maelezo yako ya FTP au SSH.','We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable.'=>'Hatuwezi kuunda folda ndani ya saraka yako ya vipakizi, kwa hivyo hakuna mahali pa kuandika kifurushi. Angalia ikiwa wp-content/uploads inaweza kuandikika.','There is no package being built. Start one first.'=>'Hakuna kifurushi kinachoundwa. Anzisha kimoja kwanza.','We could not open the package file for writing.'=>'Haikuwezekana kufungua faili ya kifurushi kwa ajili ya kuandika.','We could not write the database export.'=>'Hatukuweza kuandika uhamishaji wa hifadhidata.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya mtumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Uhosti wa Zinn® wa WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamishaji wa bure na paneli dhibiti iliyoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizothibitishwa, vikoa na uwekaji wa viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa salama hadi pande zote ziridhike.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii kujikimu kimaisha','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari zaidi ya huduma 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwaruhusu watoe zabuni.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama madokezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Huduma ya usasishaji ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha kupakua kwa usasishaji huu. Hakikisha kuwa tovuti hii inaweza kufikia jukwaa la Zinn®, kisha jaribu tena.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya sasisho ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa katika ukaguzi wa utimilifu na halikusakinishwa.']];